    <entry>
      <title>DevOps OnBoarding</title>
      <link href="/pages/analytics/wiki/devops-onboarding/"/>
      <url>/pages/analytics/wiki/devops-onboarding/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h3 id="1-Pre-Boarding-Logistics">1. Pre-Boarding Logistics</h3><ul><li><strong>Hardware &amp; accounts</strong> – laptop, 2FA setup, VPN setup, pager/on-call phone.</li><li><strong>HR &amp; mandatory training</strong> – HIPAA/security awareness, hospital policies.</li><li><strong>Software licenses</strong> – IDE, paid SaaS tooling, AWS/Azure credits if applicable.<sup class="footnote-ref"><a href="#fn1" id="fnref1">[1]</a></sup></li></ul><hr><h2 id="Sources">Sources</h2><hr class="footnotes-sep"><section class="footnotes"><ol class="footnotes-list"><li id="fn1" class="footnote-item"><p><a href="https://github.com/asciinema/asciinema-player#self-hosting-quick-start">https://github.com/asciinema/asciinema-player#self-hosting-quick-start</a> <a href="#fnref1" class="footnote-backref">↩︎</a></p></li></ol></section>]]></content>
      
      
